  "钢缆装上期间（通常从阵亡将士纪念日前的周五到 10 月第二个周一的第二天）登顶都要许可证。每年 3 月 1–31 日（美东时间）预抽签，4 月中旬出结果，一份申请最多 6 人；徒步季每天另有两天前的抽签：0:00–16:00（太平洋时间）申请，当晚出结果。申请费 $10，中签每人再付 $10，每天最多 300 人。": "A permit is required to climb to the summit whenever the cables are up (usually from the Friday before Memorial Day to the day after the second Monday in October). The preseason lottery runs March 1–31 (Eastern Time) each year, with results in mid-April; each application covers up to six people. During hiking season there's also a daily lottery two days ahead: apply midnight–4 p.m. Pacific Time, and results come out that evening. The application fee is $10, winners pay another $10 per person, and the limit is 300 people a day.",
  "园内酒店（Yosemite Hospitality）": "In-park lodging (Yosemite Hospitality)",
