  "Camp 4 营地": "Camp 4",
  "攀岩者常住的步行营地，旺季提前 7 天、每天早上 7 点（太平洋时间）滚动放出；11 月起恢复先到先得。官网写的是 2025 年的预约季（4 月 18 日到 10 月 31 日），以当年公告为准。": "A walk-in campground popular with climbers. In peak season, sites are released on a rolling basis 7 days ahead, every day at 7 a.m. Pacific Time; from November it goes back to first come, first served. The official page still lists the 2025 reservation season (April 18–October 31); check that year's announcement.",
  "谷底 Pines 营地、Wawona、Hodgdon Meadow 营地": "Pines campgrounds (Yosemite Valley), Wawona, and Hodgdon Meadow",
  "每月 15 日早上 7 点（太平洋时间）一次放出 5 个月后那一段（当月 15 日到下月 14 日）的营位，几分钟就订光。只有 Upper Pines 全年要预约，Wawona 和 Hodgdon Meadow 大约 4–10 月要预约，其余时间先到先得。": "On the 15th of each month at 7 a.m. Pacific Time, sites are released in one block for the period 5 months out (the 15th of that month through the 14th of the next), and they're gone within minutes. Only Upper Pines requires reservations year-round; Wawona and Hodgdon Meadow require them roughly April–October and are first come, first served the rest of the year.",
