  "这几个营地在 Recreation.gov 上提前 4 个月滚动放出（Recreation.gov 大多数营地是美东时间上午 10 点放号）；两座公园几乎所有营地都要提前预约。": "These campgrounds are released on Recreation.gov on a rolling basis 4 months ahead (most Recreation.gov campgrounds release sites at 10 a.m. Eastern Time). Nearly every campground in the two parks requires a reservation.",
  "Crystal Cave 溶洞导览": "Crystal Cave tours",
