  "上岛船票（Island Packers）": "Boat tickets to the islands (Island Packers)",
  "上岛只能坐公园唯一的船运特许商 Island Packers（Ventura 或 Oxnard 出发）或自己的船，没有固定开售日，按官网船期提前订，夏季和周末常售罄；露营的要先订好船再马上订营位。Santa Rosa Island 受山火影响部分区域关闭，行前看官网公告。": "The only ways to reach the islands are Island Packers, the park's sole boat concessioner (departing from Ventura or Oxnard), or your own boat. There's no set release date: book ahead according to the schedule on its website, as summer and weekend trips often sell out. If you're camping, book the boat first and then your campsite right away. Parts of Santa Rosa Island are closed because of wildfire; check the park's alerts before you go.",
  "约书亚树营地": "Joshua Tree campgrounds",
