  "Gold Bluffs Beach / Fern Canyon 开车进入预约": "Gold Bluffs Beach / Fern Canyon vehicle permit",
  "5 月 15 日到 9 月 15 日开车去 Gold Bluffs Beach 和 Fern Canyon 要网上预约（Redwood Parks Conservancy 发放，预约免费，另交 $12 日票或出示年卡），每年 12 月 15 日开放、最早提前 6 个月订，另有名额在前一天早上 9 点（太平洋时间）放出，不接受当天预约。从 Prairie Creek 游客中心走 James Irvine Trail 过去不用预约；住 Gold Bluffs Beach 或 Elk Prairie 营地的人也不用。": "From May 15 to September 15, driving to Gold Bluffs Beach and Fern Canyon requires an online permit (issued by Redwood Parks Conservancy; the permit is free, but you also pay the $12 day-use fee or show your annual pass). Booking opens December 15 each year, up to 6 months ahead, and more permits are released the day before at 9 a.m. Pacific Time; same-day permits aren't available. You don't need a permit if you hike in from Prairie Creek Visitor Center on the James Irvine Trail, or if you're staying at the Gold Bluffs Beach or Elk Prairie campground.",
  "Tall Trees 步道口通行预约": "Tall Trees trailhead access permit",
