  "必须预约（Lassen Lodging），官方没写几号开订，名额很少、越早越好；吃饭、骑马对一日游客也要预约。2024 年整季关闭，2025 年才重开。": "Reservations are required (Lassen Lodging), but the official pages don't give an opening date. Space is very limited, so book early; day visitors also need to reserve meals and horseback rides. It was closed all of 2024 and reopened in 2025.",
  "Manzanita Lake、Butte Lake、Summit Lake 营地": "Manzanita Lake, Butte Lake and Summit Lake campgrounds",
